* CHATBOT CONFIG - settings of the CHATBOT service machine (A-disk)
* KEY value; '*' starts a comment line.
*
* persona and language a new sender starts with
DEFNPC tchaika
DEFLANG en
* answer line width (3270: keep at 72 or less)
WIDTH 72
* YES = crisis words get the persona's care text (recommended)
CRISIS YES
* command that runs the bot, requests per bot run, reader check (s)
BOTCMD RXVM CHATBOT CMS
MAXBATCH 20
INTERVAL 30
* fixed random seed for testing only; leave out in production
* SEED 7
* variables the persona scripts may read ([NAME] / $NAME.)
VAR SYSTEM VM/370
